'' RUN: constants folded as the same expression runs: a 32-bit unsigned operand widens
'' by zero-extension, the bitwise operators keep the result's signedness, 'clng' of
'' an integer wraps, and 'asc'/'len' of an escaped literal read its decoded text.
'' Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/constfold-unsigned.bas -o tests/codegen/constfoldunsigned.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/constfoldunsigned.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: K1  9.223372036854776e+018
